DECISION
  id: {{ decision.id }}
  score: {{ decision.score }} / 1000
  band: {{ decision.band }}
  outcome: {{ decision.decision }}
  model version: {{ decision.model_version }}
{% if decision.graph_uplift %}  score uplift from entity linkage: +{{ '%.2f'|format(decision.graph_uplift) }}
{% endif %}
REASON CODES (the only factors you may cite; each one CONTRIBUTED to the risk, none records the applicant's actual value)
{% for r in reasons %}  - {{ r.feature }}: {{ r.reason }}{% if r.ecoa_category %} [{{ r.ecoa_category }}]{% endif %}{% if r.contribution is not none %} (contribution {{ '%.4f'|format(r.contribution) }}){% endif %}
{% else %}  (none recorded on this decision)
{% endfor %}
GRAPH SIGNALS (facts recorded for this decision)
{% for label, value in signals %}  - {{ label }}: {{ value }}
{% else %}  (none recorded)
{% endfor %}
SIMILAR PAST CASES
{% if similar %}{% for s in similar %}  - case {{ s.decision_id[:8] }}: score {{ s.score }} ({{ s.band }}), similarity {{ s.similarity }}
{% endfor %}{% else %}  None found.
{% endif %}
ANALYST QUESTION
  {{ question }}
